{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":46,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܒܢܝ̈ ܩܘܪܚ. ܥܠܔ ܥܠܡܘܬ. ܙܡܪܬ‌ܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܐܸܠܲܢ ܒܹܝܬ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ ܘܥܘܼܫܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܝܲܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܓܵܘ ܐܘܼܠܨܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܒܟܠܔ ܥܕܵܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܬ ܐܵܗܵܐ، ܠܹܐ ܙܵܕܥܲܚ ܟܲܕ ܫܲܚܠܸܦܵܐ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܟܲܕ ܫܵܥܫܝܼ ܛܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܒܥܘܼܡܩܵܐ ܕܝܵܡܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܫܵܓ݂ܫܝܼ ܘܓܲܒܓܸܒܝܼ ܡܝܼܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܪܲܬܪܸܬ‌ܝܼ ܛܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܒܪܝܵܡܬܵܝܗ‌ܝ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܬ ܢܲܗܪܵܐ ܕܫܵܩܝܼܵܬܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܚܕܝܼ ܠܡܕܝܼܢ݇ܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܲܫܟܢܵܐ ܩܲܕܝܼܫܵܐ ܕܥܸܠܵܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܒܓܵܘܘܼܗ̇ ܝܠܹܗ، ܠܹܐ ܫܵܥܫܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܗܲܝܸܪܵܗ̇ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܒܕܝܵܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܨܲܦܪܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܓ݂ܝܼܫ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ، ܫܥܝܼܫ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܡܲܠܟܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܘܼܪܸܡ ܠܹܗ ܩܵܠܹܗ، ܦܫܝܼܪܵܗ̇ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܚܲܝܠܬܵܢܵܐ ܥܲܡܲܢ ܝܼܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܠܥܵܐ ܐܸܠܲܢ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܹܝܡܘܼܢ ܚܙܹܝܡܘܼܢ ܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܡܘܼܝܬܹ‌ܐ ܠܹܗ ܚܪ̈ܵܒܹܐ ܒܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܡܲܟܠܹܐ ܦܠܵܫܹ̈ܐ ܗܲܠܔ ܡܲܪܙܵܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܬܵܒܹܪ ܩܸܫܬܵ‌ܐ، ܘܟܹܐ ܫܵܡܹܛ ܪܘܼܡܚܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܡܲܩܸܕ ܡܲܪ̈ܟܒ݂ܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܒܢܘܼܪܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܐܵܡܹܪ: ”ܗܘܹܝܡܘܼܢ ܫܸܠܝܹܐ ܘܝܕܹܥܡܘܼܢ ܕܐܵܢܵܐ ܝܘܸܢ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܦܵܝܫܹܢ ܡܘܼܪܡܵܐ ܓܵܘ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܦܵܝܫܹܢ ܡܘܼܪܡܵܐ ܒܐܲܪܥܵܐ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܚܲܝܠܬܵܢܵܐ ܥܲܡܲܢ ܝܼܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܠܥܵܐ ܐܸܠܲܢ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/46.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/47.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/45.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}